meta {
  name: 03_DelegationRequestValidation
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: The delegation request endpoint rejects invalid requests

    When both a resource and a package are given the request fails
    When neither a resource nor a package is given the request fails
    When a party is given with an unsupported URN the request fails
    When the token lacks the write scope the request is forbidden

  No step creates a request, so the scenario needs no cleanup.
}
